Part 2: U[J,Jp] = sqrt((2J+1)(2Jp+1)) {j j J; j j Jp}; check U[.,Jp]/U[.,0] = poly of degree Jp in J(J+1)
 j = 1/2  n =  2  orthogonal: yes  max residual deg-Jp fit = 3.3e-16  degree exactly Jp: True  min|U[J,0]| = 0.500
